  "body": "## Changelog\n* 4a98c6abedda3906ae7c6c772e581a787028d260 Keep waiting when a Machine update is still replacing (#5588)\n* 1305ff9f6dc7bc416136523b172178255bcb145b fix(volumes): select volume before resolving relative size (#5440)\n* af28457af31b49bad9911c04a65b4a5c0b3cf33d Pass each env and metadata entry as its own flag in the machine MCP tools (#5576)\n* cd17d03f08fcbb0e06ddeedaca1c5489a73f98e6 Retry the release lookup when fly scale count can’t verify a process group (#5584)\n* 7e38a562d07824f634c367851350712e31ae1b03 Make the fly-machine-update MCP tool run machine update (#5451)\n* 64e7a58747cfb99f94ce324eb2cf68b2b7773a82 chore(deps): bump j178/prek-action from 3.1.0 to 3.1.1 (#5539)\n* ad77e86f7e23f8be89a098924fdfcc29d8d4a59a fix: detect machine update failures (#4921)\n* fae12c2e93d1c974c409bd3a663b9580d76910b1 Let services default to the only process group (#5549)\n\n"
